<title>USA: US March S&amp;P 500 cuts losses on late shortcovering.</title>
<headline>US March S&amp;P 500 cuts losses on late shortcovering.</headline>
<text>
<p>Jan 2 - U.S. March S&amp;P 500 futures recovered some of its lost ground in late trade as local shortcovering and buying by two dealers kicked in. Traders said volume picking up on the rebound from the lower end of the range. &quot;We just overdid for the last two days,&quot; S&amp;P floor source said.</p>
